    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f9515a5703ef124878c9457",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫特别周！\\n梦想是成为日本第一的赛马娘！\\n为了让妈妈们感到欣慰，我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ca9fbb196091f984161acbd4170f7de6d5c2fa5a768352e0504114d898bf76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b7f6be9ea9e137ea0e33fe6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字是无声铃鹿。\\n喜欢的事情是奔跑。那前方的景色，不会让给任何人。\\n嗯……那个，就是这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95676b78b0f3a16d8d1d73e89f456496dd88a14dfc0d796b752916be19f006db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:387de85e6002df08a1ebb8a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀吼，我是东海帝王！\\n事关不败的三冠赛马娘，\\n我绝——对不会错过！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37a517d69faaa11cff3c06d3a991f0bf0a1f4c61961d9c7d8d2c4d8017709ba1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4673f2c78ce8ba6a0e207c74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Hi～，我是丸善斯基哟！\\n你也是来看的吧？我那异次元般的跑法。\\n哼哼♪被迷的神魂颠倒的话……我可不管哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "24dcae83a61984ad3ed255c7be2ac5935be8e698b53da5475ee4203d40b7d64a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42e80671edabaf6665c32618",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是小栗帽。\\n为了让故乡支持我的大家都能够开心，\\n我会全力以赴的。请多关照",
      "source_fingerprint": "53abbcb94c82b41cb628ba5136671d030bc1bef223b39d5aa3a2542d29beb8bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67c0bb46d72bcc0bfd157a42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哟，是我黄金船大人哒！\\n在火焰中、草地中！或是宇宙的尽头都无所谓！\\n无论身处何处我都要探寻有趣的东西～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e15a26ee2ed0584df4cb27f59703d710a3915fa243f1ffe06fd849830dcda36c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a86428923a4f7de2177719b3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦！我是伏特加！\\n我的原则就是做一个比谁都要帅气的赛马娘！\\n逊爆了的事情是不会做的。给我记好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a417d31ce47a7486fca08853b6ec92e06e3452b419e5de0d457ed37ca9a64e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfc0693fba1d15cab7acb5e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Howdy！我叫大树快车！\\n我要用我充满力量感的赛跑给大家带来Happy！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa2187dbc6ecfe06f92fdd2cc6dd664cf10a52eaa873314044f33252a80a62fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0979f8d37efda82367b47f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫草上飞。\\n正因以赛马娘的姿态存在于此\\n才想在这条“道路”上穷尽一切，直至尽头。呼呼♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecc2c32691888878087729b54b8713fceb418c5aa419d562403bd4ba9642ff29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d8f057b87156d6a0ed80b42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我的名字叫目白麦昆。\\n我的家族，目白家夙愿的“天皇赏”制霸——\\n必定用我这双脚实现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df788bc9322d43aede70653cd0f867153812743c47c87114cb50119b1641da80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b940fe88071153e8112615a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "疾驰在赛场上的深红色怪鸟！\\n神鹰参·上·Death！\\n以世界为目标，奋勇前进吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ed89fe4c7a4d3a6509e552a065cf9769ee59215ab48a48d4a28ca638feb5b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d051d3c5afce41dd3aa6e207",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哈—哈哈哈！我就是最强、\\n最美丽的“霸王”好歌剧！\\n来吧！让我们开始传说之路吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a26afc6c16ed6db2bc1b6ef9de46760447f93e7846a015075c5a5a3539f7c3d1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20fd8c8558873850359add79",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是鲁道夫象征。是站在所有赛马娘顶点并指引她们前进，被称为“皇帝”的人。\\n志同道合的训练员啊，一起勇往直前，征服一切吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb778e048cc6db88042bc5de6c21294943de078ac31ba40475ab76205b1c1362",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5b1789cceedefa6ffc1f2a2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呀吼，是青云天空哦。\\n现在就适度的放松一下吧。\\n……因为想要钓大鱼的话，放长线是很重要的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cca9cfa4f8fd43a8290dd6518582a14e54becbf47e7c67708b2a7827ea07bcda",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0650eb8e1ebbb936da6a72d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我叫……米浴。那，那个……？\\n米浴，会让大家陷入不幸……是没用的孩子\\n……但，但是为了能够改变……我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded49ea764622f4505e5d435ac92d0b610ffaa0de6d9a0b213880745678e7202",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f601cfc39c46bc3af1f67a63",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我，我！我的梦想是成为德比赛马娘！\\n还有就是……啊！！名字！！！！\\n我叫胜利奖券！请多关照！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f969403fae6f0afdc2b0a63e456a91add1633cf0da6b0e59ac4b3901a5a09c68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f67603aeb2dce35817b489",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是黄金城市。……事先说好，如果你只是把我当成\\n一个漂亮人偶来对待的话，我是不会原谅你的。\\n不要靠外表去判断我，而是靠跑法来判断。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcefcd837a5057223aa3d4b44e2d14f60dd2051e9548e4e8e338e599385fbf87",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb0f8f683f6010095eea18dc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你好！我叫樱花进王！\\n正如你所见，是一位出色的班长！\\n为了成为大家的榜样，上吧！爆进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "90f7bca8f69558a60f934f62bbe2d6862ab26e5b6bd312386c9c567a34ac7706",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dee8b4bf8a299d883524fe3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼呼～我是超级溪流哟～\\n为了大家的笑容，我会非～常努力的。就交给我吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c66bc8636a11f001672de9721b03367344ac93cc4d4bb7a1c2755524e238a9fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:781badffa8b4aff90866107c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我是春丽！喜欢的东西是胡萝卜\\n还有因为奔跑很开心所以也最～喜欢了♪\\n以第一名为目标，我会努力的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6b23c853e707a960695b555ec1cab53a7917f2fe30129dd4dee893a421f5655",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2022b3693f68debda07316cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您好，我是特雷森学园的理事长秘书骏川手纲。\\n为了让大家能够过上更好的学园生活，\\n我会全力支援您的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "69dd42e6caeaec2788354ebf403d5ba13ab115c858b7ad0b725ae38967f3db5f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb1f7be719f7bf4cf6f8071a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "您好，我叫桐生院葵。\\n虽然作为特雷森学园的新人训练员还远远不够成熟，\\n但为了赛马娘们的未来，我会全力以赴加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4aa9c8f9fd6f40abba095bfc6aa4ea44345efd3387943067af1ddf956f83c11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "88",
        "10022"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
